    </div>
    <div class="hero-bake-card" aria-label="A sample bakery payout"><div class="bake-card-top"><span>Today’s orders</span><strong>12</strong></div><div class="cake-illustration" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><i></i><b></b></div><div class="bake-total"><span>Estimated payout</span><strong>KES 8,640</strong></div><div class="bake-status"><span></span> Ready for your next bake</div></div>
